  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat the sesame oil over medium heat",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and saute until fragrant",
    "Add the beef and cook until browned on all sides",
    "Add the allspice, soy sauce, and korean chili flakes and stir to combine",
    "Add the beef broth and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 2 hours",
    "Using a bain-marie, cook the stew for an additional 30 minutes",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste",
    "Serve hot over rice or noodles"
